"⟪k:98⟫⟪k:99⟫Erano passati diversi giorni da quando avevo lasciato la capitale,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d8391c1ef87982e314f1c54412fe22e4b963e2c287dfdb7bd562b2f594202cd
#. default-sha256: de6ef5464e1883a2b3670bc05559e7cf9eab88d28f103dd708502a4b34d350f7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I could still see it when I closed my eyes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the people lined up on the Grand-"
"Pont, awaiting entry, eager to start a new life there. Brimming with hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e riuscivo ancora a vederle quando chiudevo gli occhi—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫le persone allineate "
"sul Grand-Pont, in attesa di entrare,⟪k:4⟫impazienti di iniziare una nuova vita. Piene di "
"speranze."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afdc0c72d7ccfbe3ed316c595810edd5521194b4cd9ab6c641ff173d0c730c3c
#. default-sha256: 8693f04a6fd50cbdd20c165e2291586bde08c15671dd26ab07e62110a29567e7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a city people were willing to pay high taxes to live in. ⟪k:1⟫If you were a "
"performer, you could get some of those costs shaved down a bit by putting those skills to use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La gente era disposta a pagare tasse elevate pur di vivere in quella città.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se eri "
"un musicista, o un attore, potevi sfruttare le tue abilità per ridurre i costi delle imposte."

#: scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb1bd9b22ac58958bf3a9ba1985c1d1b43687cc8ad79bf14370276020ff9aa94
#. default-sha256: 95687fd72a78ce826bb0c73093410bd8755e27cbc2e03611cf82abd712df1c51
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The capital was harsh on those who wanted in, and apathetic about all who left."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La capitale era severa con quelli che volevano entrare,⟪k:1⟫e apatica verso tutti coloro che "
"se ne andavano."

#: scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f59e385d1c426cc6b0039b19bd3588c2733c23e6392dc76403eecb35e286ce8
#. default-sha256: 0392295ff831da8ff198cc5d407698532930befe0f46600fdab82c739daaee5c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was composed of a powerful nobility and clergy,⟪k:1⟫wealthy merchants and bankers, and a "
"large population of poor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And it was the city I had called home for a long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era composta da una nobiltà e un clero potenti, da ricchi mercanti e banchieri, e da un gran "
"numero di persone povere.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ed era la città che ho chiamato “casa” per molto tempo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e877bd8b14f6dd68a9bfc024bb7ad61cdfae3533566510a62d6ca096d6e750ea
#. default-sha256: af9fd921ff2a65800e675db1a4d7394ae8fcd9ade00e12821b3eb21885a63b21
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know much about where I was heading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non avevo idea di quale fosse la mia destinazione."

#: scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bc076942fe613b1dd79a10d8fcb82ac0f6895406b6f6e8111eeecb13fdd23d8
#. default-sha256: 539aa880937ccd975db78b53437b43d3e2abfc08f57bb286dfc604af07ef23a8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s getting foggy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Looks like it might rain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sta calando la nebbia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sembra che stia per piovere..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da6553f1fa356d540e7ded9eba8f72f90830d38bc7efc41c8da5177ef78efeef
#. default-sha256: 1f641819fa4490b136de5b0b6278d7d5ecdc7958494bb6748fd91d33955312d0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe we should take a little break.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You want to keep going? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫all "
"right, then."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forse dovremmo fermarci un attimo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Ah, vuole proseguire? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫"
"d’accordo, allora."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77d08e0461e4583ad94eb9e3ebfd3849301705ffbea551b796467aa67001aed4
#. default-sha256: f80a2a5a6cd9b83cd22c5862157f30c1b52271b13de962645dd6e96cb9cd102a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The coachman was frustratingly taciturn.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He acted as though he had gotten stuck "
"transporting a prisoner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il cocchiere era fastidiosamente taciturno.⟪k:1⟫ Si comportava come se fosse stato costretto "
"a trasportare un prigioniero."

#: scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d155cc65088d20a66b2e74460ec7669d4d55c076b20319855bf62ee6b5efb6b0
#. default-sha256: 4f4694db8aea45b6ab3533d72bab0acb8fef2f0f766778dcf4b0fa1576b31b60
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though that was hardly a stretch.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his point of view, I was nothing more than a "
"criminal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eppure la sua non era una reazione esagerata.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dopotutto, dal suo punto di vista, "
"non ero altro che una criminale."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ead9e3aa38755d35d9e0e85f28d4fc71509563de1631abd31c7056969b24c7a2
#. default-sha256: bcb33ed852326e9f41b6269481b67e4d2ec7b708c7b57bcc6873dce6675f351b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the times he ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ acknowledge I had said anything,⟪k:3⟫he made no effort to "
"hide the scorn in his eyes—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche quelle volte in cui si ⟪k:1⟫degnava⟪k:2⟫ di riconoscere che avevo detto qualcosa, non "
"faceva alcuno sforzo per celare il disprezzo nei propri occhi,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25abeacd84784b07facbeeaf890f0c9de5e67883be9689507231ffc864eec5a9
#. default-sha256: d238e3e43f607273f8774d83f895a150c62539502e9537497a64a88e918e6960
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_466146D6_F1B1_6580_2D64_293899220B4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫to pretend he didn’t regret ever taking this job."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫né nascondeva il rimorso per aver accettato quell’incarico."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0ef8d4eaae17ec7533274adf86b5097d8bb47b1a8138dddb96d9a777e3d5163
#. default-sha256: 090683db4bbb5ec5610d309255e8e8c00e13b61fbd8f42d275d1eb4bc0b2ad73
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I would just fall silent again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così tornai nuovamente in silenzio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efc705f3128cd902180e6e085e74e4b8cdc9ca807d80eac65ce49750964cc72
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 914919f7b188e409c2fb20fcbc819ba775fa1ab72f38022b7826042b50aadeb9
#. default-sha256: aa68e6e4a6aefc598758d2f9ae0e43e1054cead6140b5f8e2c6ba01fd8b1787e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The road was gradually getting narrower. ⟪k:1⟫We had long since left the paved city roads "
"behind, and were now traveling along a couple worn-down grooves in the forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La strada si faceva gradualmente più angusta.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ci eravamo lasciati alle spalle le "
"strade pavimentate della città⟪k:3⟫già da un bel po’, e ci ritrovammo a viaggiare su dei solchi "
"logori⟪k:4⟫nel bel mezzo della foresta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5df76d612a96daa8990bdc011ae8337fe7b16e01f1af8239d2431000ce8bc902
#. default-sha256: 08f374060a5c187a7a443a1a686099b38d780953c9798a13510e3d1204c62b0a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did I end up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Come ero finita a quel punto?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6f2696cadd0b8a951a2053b6c79b64a3abb0169177a46a2a408910a453f40b8
#. default-sha256: 130b42da351e3260874264943f69d5421c9bb4f80f994fa57c7625455af3bc6b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I being subjected to this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché dovevo subire tutto quello?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e002eb16824339e3b46704d5a3a113739d4a04911d74890f0b5c905587cb9614
#. default-sha256: 7137e7f19f8edaecc02cc18211e0423c16193c7606f59687af0e5d27a5bdc266
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was done thinking about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avevo smesso di pensarci."

#: scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80f5f2eff3743078d6863c7af3ea956aa07874dde5d13be6c49936c607857bc7
#. default-sha256: cc7175266a85d7b5815db84288a28304510b1664a0988050c03b87e0474bef33
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more I thought on it, the less fair it seemed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The more I remembered, the worse "
"it hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Più ci pensavo, e più mi sembrava ingiusto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Più ricordavo, e più mi faceva male."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43a074cb071e826b5c567b1f8af327f63bf3e774fe11cdd917357c9485c32e91
#. default-sha256: 8463ec777ca10baefdea7cf067a7cba8a69f168bed87b647df5dd8ba59f1a507
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do anymore was close my eyes and weather the storm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tutto ciò che potevo fare era chiudere gli occhi,⟪k:1⟫e resistere alla tempesta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3db284e390d1320a1ea9ac87db34687d83f5041b8fad03744f89e07bc940212
#. default-sha256: 9e58761a67b8331f5a827c4e4022f7a31c2d06f500b54db496b313106d0983dd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep within the dense woods, a mansion appeared before us like the world fading into view "
"after a dream."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In fondo a quella fitta foresta, una villa apparve dinanzi a noi,⟪k:1⟫come il mondo che "
"riemerge dopo un sogno."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bee1ddd85657631b2e703e313611b3fc9af6446e5a6afc2f86632331df05f42
