msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t seem to be an especially large house, but it had obviously been constructed with a "
"great deal of care, and it was, thankfully, not standing in ruins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sembrava essere una casa particolarmente grande, ma era ovvio che fosse stata costruita "
"con molta cura, e fortunatamente non era in rovina."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3788015_73C0_4F3F_B586_E9C643EA713F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 590c51049e8efe139282a67fdc1d5a6f74224c0f21ad1fc18814dd4138ad9f97
