msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage came to a stop, and the coachman climbed down, signaling with his chin for "
"me to get out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non appena ci fermammo, il cocchiere scese dalla carrozza,⟪k:2⟫e con un cenno del capo "
"mi intimò di uscire."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A2CBB44E_DE6C_4EA0_989D_489BCD9DEE67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c59dbb3173bee31ebe1980f08ac0dd325e2341b639dfb195822688d937bb051e
