#: scenario5:scenario5_486A044B_3F25_4FFA_87D2_B333912CED00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c48bd9932a532a52dae2e91c26dbe9aa1f61a7ef3926f1bcb331eba22111b3eb
