msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But the driver didn’t even acknowledge me, getting back onto the carriage and setting "
"off into the forest. ⟪k:2⟫He seemed to want to get as far away from here as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma l’uomo non mi diede alcuna considerazione;⟪k:2⟫ rimontò sul carro⟪k:3⟫e si addentrò "
"nuovamente nella foresta. ⟪k:4⟫Sembrava volesse allontanarsi da lì il prima possibile."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0EB7448_EA84_49D4_B720_AB7239CE0533
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14c65d92cd97a0af312524e1e4aab96ad15fe4a5515915627d977dd2e111f52e
