msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0EB7448_EA84_49D4_B720_AB7239CE0533"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He could have said ⟪k:1⟫something⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Oh well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avrebbe potuto dire ⟪k:1⟫qualcosa⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Ahh, beh."

#: scenario5:scenario5_827B93B2_F3C2_4AC9_A4BD_BE34EA2EEF42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
