msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6D58D3F_229A_41CD_97BE_845154F0A15F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t blame anyone for my being here—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫or for his wanting to get out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non potevo incolpare nessuno per il fatto che mi trovavo lì—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫né potevo "
"incolpare il cocchiere per aver voluto lasciare quel posto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BFC55AC_FFAD_4E12_8710_D41919BCF157
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
