msgid "⟪k:0⟫I should get going, I guess."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dovrei andare, suppongo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1CA57776_7356_4025_A27B_329655EA4278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
