msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Getting a better look at it, the house’s windows were, strangely enough, "
"all shuttered. ⟪k:5⟫It was probably dark as pitch inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Era alquanto strano—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫osservandola meglio, quella casa aveva le "
"finestre tutte serrate. ⟪k:7⟫Probabilmente al suo interno era buio come la pece."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A724C40_ED30_4C78_B68C_EB6C84ABFD7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd93596205efd0946d7c322e53927d78ae0d022b9f794656532c18f7857a2f23
