msgid "⟪k:0⟫Does no one live here?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But if that’s the case... ⟪k:3⟫then why was I...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non ci abita nessuno qui?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma allora... ⟪k:3⟫perché sono stata...?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_601A846D_32C6_4C82_BE18_670590283ECF
