msgid "⟪k:0⟫What if I couldn’t get in?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had no idea what else there was in the area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E se non fossi riuscita a entrare?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non avevo la minima idea di cosa ci fosse in "
"quella zona."

#: scenario5:scenario5_ECC7D8A0_BC39_4C3F_BBEF_CB1E4B4EC2CD
