msgid "⟪k:0⟫If the door didn’t open... ⟪k:1⟫then I would die out here in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se la porta non si fosse aperta...  ⟪k:1⟫allora sarei morta lì, nella foresta."

#: scenario5:scenario5_96CB48EE_70D3_4E0F_A6A9_9A4F60AF547B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
