msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door was heavy, and though it seemed to protest my attempts to "
"enter, it still opened much easier than I was expecting. ⟪k:5⟫I was worried over nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La porta era pesante, e anche se sembrava protestare ai miei tentativi "
"di entrare, si aprì comunque più facilmente di quanto mi aspettassi.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mi stavo "
"preoccupando per niente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f73fd851659d784c16601a28138880af650198e50f47c3bff373637ce655ff76
#. default-sha256: f22b87ef964eaf4f9e86158f82555bcc2deec52d29200713affe2fc838dc44eb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E96A4D5_B182_48CD_A393_D3FE2E56272F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking in, I got the strangest impression that light was being swallowed up into the "
"mansion’s depths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Guardando all’interno, avevo la strana impressione che la luce fosse stata inghiottita nelle "
"profondità della villa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3F907F55_0D51_441D_A556_94B54A631800
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 762c83cf8a541a7d9bd86569a7922bd1cec427351cfd5aebda112b00551cbe27
#. default-sha256: eec656b57e5eea3f21e6bcfa4a00086a66574657d5d35755460bdd584137f97c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3F907F55_0D51_441D_A556_94B54A631800"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rather than going ⟪k:1⟫inside⟪k:2⟫, it felt as though I was about to step outside the "
"boundaries of this world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Piuttosto che star ⟪k:1⟫entrando⟪k:2⟫, sembrava come se stessi per mettere piede ⟪k:3⟫"
"fuori⟪k:4⟫ dal confine del mondo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_25B6144A_65A8_4DD9_99AC_EB85CDC4080B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7415c1b14452cc10e9b08b59a41a8546ae65b176e6b8bcbf1cc80c7cdc755a36
#. default-sha256: 1f40a26d81fae3ab8b6373d48a99d6f34772964d878bc664d012c032267acb14
