msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫When I closed the door, it "
"was so dark I couldn’t even tell where I was walking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Dopo aver richiuso la porta, "
"era così buio che non sapevo nemmeno dove stavo camminando."

#: scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42827fb47fc27f621465a0d0bfa95a0b971991468203bdc62a46fd3ea96e6265
