msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_16AF63CF_68EA_4DDB_8B19_97AFC13E8226"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wonder... ⟪k:2⟫if the windows open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Chissà se le finestre si aprono."

#: scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7718f3d4f9c3244182488a899ad5024bbb354f78bbfafe1e5a39d7ac768f9317
#. default-sha256: 2286b934996b29a01557e94bfb7b7d9efe3b1a17ee6f48219b8f7bc36268c423
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_AA15CF14_500D_4B38_AF57_947AC84E078C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though I managed to fumble my way over to a window, it was tightly shuttered, and the "
"shutters caked with rust.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was probably not getting it open without a fight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fossi riuscita ad avvicinarmi lentamente a una finestra,⟪k:1⟫questa era chiusa e le "
"imposte erano incrostate di ruggine.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Probabilmente non sarei riuscita ad aprirla senza "
"faticare."

#: scenario5:scenario5_708F7434_8D11_4346_B7E3_BC379E0CC7CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e5d176e61554e0cda978e6539861e5b003d44d788ccd6dca6f67ab48e31dd66
