msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_708F7434_8D11_4346_B7E3_BC379E0CC7CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darn... ⟪k:1⟫not a hint of light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cavolo... ⟪k:1⟫non c’è un filo di luce."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcd32166c59d5d50caef198d007ab9fdcd013ed089816bd1c622e3b73a28d5b5
#. default-sha256: 0b2dae7c7f3ac98c8ced382240cd8b685cd2b19048721f7199c3d7401078ab6f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t even see my hand waving in front of my face.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It felt as though the floor "
"would fall out from under me and I would sink into eternal darkness if I didn’t watch my step."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riuscivo neanche a vedere la mano mentre la agitavo davanti⟪k:1⟫a me.⟪k:2⟫ Avevo come la "
"sensazione che se non fossi stata attenta a dove avrei messo i piedi, il pavimento sarebbe potuto "
"crollare sotto di me, facendomi precipitare nell’abisso più profondo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7632606b9952a117a831e44d059111785488528946a269a45e49a52955e28adf
#. default-sha256: 7d70015be710f6bcf8a0db11ee96e15ac2f96b2ed4bf23a23fac97a107b86dc7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF3C5408_3F37_4E00_9647_CAEEE588D2F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fighting back that fear, I slowly walked forward, tracing the wall with my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Combattendo quella paura, proseguii lentamente, tracciando il muro con la mano."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 596aa96ab04c4b9bc66d77b8ac22f50de867744d58379d3465ad6a52074f5a13
#. default-sha256: 2af00898e0227ea19704425e71961d00eb5d80aeb4cf6500ca8a9458db1f41a3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F5D7FD38_6FA8_4927_8806_A282F02466B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was a door at the end of a long corridor. I pulled it open, and a wisp of "
"bone-chilling air brushed past me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’era una porta alla fine di un lungo corridoio.⟪k:3⟫La aprii, e un soffio d’aria "
"agghiacciante mi colpì."

#: scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86568d8b68060f6cf6ed3182fdfdf3ed9f5c35d5a3507eb3ca9d83c76f6a864a
#. default-sha256: 639d4991b5c9f81dc56713d7e13825bace47c7b8b355e9b796352c2e896bf394
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was too dark to see anything, but I could feel something ⟪k:1⟫different⟪k:2⟫ present in "
"this area than the rest of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era troppo buio per vedere alcunché, ma riuscivo a percepire qualcosa di ⟪k:1⟫diverso⟪k:2⟫ "
"in quella zona, rispetto al resto della casa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C7D8D1A_F976_4877_91A1_2CB164E9C884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21a0bc956b6abf92f9a1b944861800cd766177d4c66aef4090c917361c811bdc
