msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B7FE4138_5A74_4965_A6EE_B0030387B0F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I pushed forward through the freezing air,⟪k:1⟫for a split second, I spotted a shimmer of "
"light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mentre mi spingevo in avanti attraverso l’aria gelida,⟪k:1⟫per una frazione di secondo, "
"notai un luccichio."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5928b4235eb35eb4eda36fdd6672195db61fc7c02a9e172459854cba657ee970
