msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Squinting my eyes, I was able to make out a large window.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Unlike the others, it "
"wasn’t shuttered."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Strizzando gli occhi, riuscii a scorgere una grande finestra.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Diversamente dalle "
"altre, non era barricata."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2DA6D4A5_42A2_4C27_B961_7871B7674FAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a295379208eaa12c2641655ccb7d9bee495d8f9b023dfca26f4512fb7a3c4916
#. default-sha256: 9c11e51c3fa8231bcd7243ae4d74f6a1deb00e620b5f585857182bcad886b900
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2DA6D4A5_42A2_4C27_B961_7871B7674FAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do we have here?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Drapes? ⟪k:3⟫I see a little light beyond—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cos’abbiamo qui?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Delle tende? ⟪k:3⟫Vedo una piccola luce—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_562B7D5B_F18A_40F6_863E_CF87BDFCCC01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4d1da609440054c34d6cfdea653997f18c74bf1023e2e5b24a601417c612541
