"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The next moment, faint but "
"colorful light shone down on me.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫It was a stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫E all’improvviso, una luce "
"debole ma colorata iniziò a risplendere⟪k:13⟫su di me.⟪k:14⟫ Era una vetrata decorata."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF0DBDF1_4A42_4E67_B2E9_56CF1C9D6DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1dddc6ab294c50539f5f59b13af01f073af90baea3dd8fa58d5edc66d0ea6d5
