msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF0DBDF1_4A42_4E67_B2E9_56CF1C9D6DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From beyond the glass, I could hear the subtle pitter-patter of rain.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had "
"finally started, it seemed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riuscivo a sentire il flebile picchiettio della pioggia oltre il vetro.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sembrava "
"che avesse iniziato a piovere."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BD7E9ED_3AC8_4F98_BC9B_8E4A52FE7EE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4a715b8dc5d83448fde7ddb6724ebe42d06b6bc148521e997e9a63095b5bea6
