msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0BD7E9ED_3AC8_4F98_BC9B_8E4A52FE7EE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The different colors of light blended into a milky white—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dim but wondrous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I diversi colori della luce si fondevano in un bianco latteo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tenue, ma stupendo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_177D9B11_1F96_4635_A010_1193C3615D29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
