msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ così bello...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sarà un angelo?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7C82706_D850_4DDC_AF6D_96B537A46A2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d553cc97f75e0133846a1857324f2cca54a2ba9dcb725d1a4e61dd8d34a3e81d
