msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Né⟪k:2⟫ le finestre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_ABC7108B_5CEF_427A_85D9_E2261981A91B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de184696384ef4b68c1fb92ee42b6d6f4aa501be1965c00bf970e80bbaeacdf4
